{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_02_end","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_02","title":"熱情，或悲愴","storyCode":"LE-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"c793505e84ebc7d05cafeeabf34cdadc7007ab2c74f107317fdd05caa001a653","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"行板竭力為芙蓉抵擋著人潮，但一個人的力量實在太過渺小。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群很快越過行板，將芙蓉團團圍住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓我說第二遍，滾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們到底在幹什麼？！她是來幫你們的，你們為什麼要這麼做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板，這事跟你沒關係！要是想保護這個魔族佬，就趕緊讓她離開夕照區！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白堊？芙蓉在裡面......她被人圍攻了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，讓開——讓我進去！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又是從哪兒冒出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我想起來了，你是之前流浪到夕照區的那小子吧？乖乖照顧你爺爺去，別多管閒事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉她明明是來幫助大家的，你們為什麼要這麼對她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這種人根本不可能懂，我們是在從魔族佬手裡保護自己的家園！滾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉不是這樣的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道芙蓉是來治礦石病的，她全心全意撲在這件事上，你們不也都看在眼裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"治礦石病？誰的礦石病被她治好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，你別來蹚這攤渾水，這裡畢竟是維謝海姆，他們不敢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰說我不敢？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瘋了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼事情衝我來，為什麼要衝著他施術？這事跟他有什麼關係？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我沒想對著人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好解釋的！再不走，你們就要和這把大提琴一樣，身上開個洞了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笛聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又從哪冒出來一個礙事的，出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——心跳得好快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*萊塔尼亞粗口*，他怎麼冒出來了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家，大家別走啊，怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒聽見嗎，那個聲音......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......難道是......難道是那位——難道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您千萬開恩，您手下留情，您——我就是多喝了幾口，絕對沒有對您不敬的意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我到底在幹什麼啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人群......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就散了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，你怎麼樣？沒受傷吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，可是琴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這大提琴......面板破得這麼嚴重，還能修嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你出手相助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初次見面——應該不是初次見面了吧。不過，我們一直沒能好好打個招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，剛才還挺危險的。雖然夕照區也是維謝海姆的一部分，但一般的治安官可不想來這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們真的動了手，短時間內未必會有人來幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再次向你表示感謝。我該怎麼稱呼你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接叫我黑鍵就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，黑鍵，他們說的預言，你聽說過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有。我也是剛剛從人群口中聽見這個詞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，這個預言完全沒有傳到高庭區，是嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高庭區？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維謝海姆的貴族應該都住在高庭區，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別把我和他們相提並論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你不是維謝海姆的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確不是維謝海姆本地人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，隨意推測一位貴族的身份可不是什麼禮貌的舉動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是專程來夕照區參加車爾尼先生的音樂會的？你也是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我並未感染礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我聽別人說，來這參加音樂會的都是感染者——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對話就到此為止吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很著急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和白堊本來想去車爾尼先生家，請他驗收我們今天練琴的成果，結果遇到了這檔事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，耽誤了你的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先回辦事處了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，別傷心了，先去車爾尼家吧。他那麼喜歡你，會給你重新挑一把琴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我不是那個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也真奇怪，我完全沒聽過什麼“陛下的預言”啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（難道是格特魯德？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是隱隱約約聽過一些......但是很模糊，也沒提什麼薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，音樂會要緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群人也真是，要是真喜歡，就應該去女皇之聲面前一口一個“那位陛下”“那位陛下”，那才好玩呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不說這些了，我們趕緊去車爾尼家吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，琴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說過了嗎，車爾尼會給你挑一把的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，這也不是你的錯，就算車爾尼要跟你計較這把琴，也還有我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"琴壞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你們也去打架鬥毆了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這樣的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來的路上，我和黑鍵遇到了芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被一幫人圍攻了，那些人說她是魔族，會給夕照區帶來災難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無稽之談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去保護芙蓉，結果......大提琴被法術打壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在街上放法術，這群人腦子到底出了什麼毛病！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你打退了他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是黑鍵用法術驅散了人群，幫我和芙蓉解了圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他？幫你解圍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這把壞琴......唉，像樣的大提琴，我也只有這一把啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別道歉了，這不是你的錯，反而是我，應該代表夕照區，替那些蠢貨給你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之你先把琴放這吧，我再找找看，有沒有別的琴給你用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就剩這把量產貨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先湊合一下，我來驗收你們練習的成果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開始吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生，您......意下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進步不是沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且對你們來說，這是首只練了一天的新曲子，我也不應該要求太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但之前的問題，幾乎一個也沒解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾乎一個也沒解決？怎麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵反應的速度快了不少，可還是會在自己的段落忘乎所以，好像在炫耀什麼一樣，最後還是要白堊來遷就你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連曲子都還沒完全熟悉，有什麼好炫耀的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那些裝飾音，倒是都吹出來了，可是連氣息都快不穩了，有意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊呢，還是比較扎實的，主要的問題也是熟練度，再練練應該會好很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但《晨暮》再怎麼說也是二重奏，不可能讓一方一直遷就另一方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我真的想撤掉《晨暮》了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不可以這樣，讓黑鍵配合您的鋼琴伴奏再試一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不會像你一樣遷就他，他出醜可不要怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）打起精神來，要一戰定勝負了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做好準備了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——怎麼樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那股炫耀的勁頭完全沒變。你覺得長笛是什麼？你炫技的工具嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全沒打算配合你的節奏，你自己的部分還是比較穩定地完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看出來了，白堊確實是在遷就你，但他只是在遷就你的習慣，不是在遷就你的水準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有待提高的地方還有一大堆，但最低標準，你算是摸到了邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（長出一口氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醜話說在前頭，我今天的標準已經拉到最低了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會隨時找你們驗收成果，如果在演出前還是只有這種水準的話，我一樣不讓你們上台，明白了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您放心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再有，白堊現在用的這把琴是把量產品，只是應急用的，我還是推薦你們換一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是您原來送我的那把已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，有我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天我們一起去買琴，我給你挑一把最好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕信的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說是那位陛下啊，那位陛下的預言！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕信的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得了，我們邊走邊說，你再詳細講講......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
